Usage: xfproduct [Options] input_files... output_file
Options can be abbreviated, current short name abbreviations are in parentheses
Options:
 -in1  OR  -InputFile1   File
    File with transforms applied first
 -in2  OR  -InputFile2   File
    File with transforms applied second
 -output (-ou)  OR  -OutputFile   File
    Output file for product transforms
 -scale (-s)  OR  -ScaleShifts   2 floats
    Factors to scale X/Y translations of the first and second transforms
 -one (-on)  OR  -OneXformToMultiply   Int
    # of one transform to multiply by a single transform (numbered from 0)
 -help (-h)  OR  -usage
    Print help output
